{"id": 729336, "slug": "bangman", "name": "Bangman", "name_original": "Bangman", "description": "<strong> Bangman </strong> is a top-down action roguelike in which you have to defeat hordes of bloodthirsty and cute monsters as you travel from world to world. <br/><br/> Embark on an exciting journey to save worlds with our heroes. Many types of weapons and spells will help you with this. <br/><br/><br/><br/>Take on the role of one of the summoned heroes and save the worlds from all waves, shooting off crowds of enemies. Each creature contains a useful item that will give you a better chance of survival. At the same time, the enemies are very tenacious and strong, so you think ten times before letting them come to you.<br/><br/><strong> New heroes </strong> <br/><br/>Unlock new characters with the help of accumulated gems and get unique abilities and weapons. <br/><br/><br/><br/><strong> Spells </strong> <br/><br/>Each spell gives you a short-term enhancement of a particular skill / characteristic, increasing your chances of winning!<br/><br/><strong>Special Skills</strong><br/><br/>The summoned heroes have their own unique abilities that deal decent damage to enemies. The main thing is to use them wisely, because recovery takes a lot of time, and it can cost you your life!<br/><br/>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2022-01-30", "tba": false, "updated": "2022-01-31T02:59:26", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/941/9411bf18dd2a177ba3d8cd9d5456bac3.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/b81/b81a960f4614d1533606851e8fbbd1ab.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 5, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0,